abstract: >-
  Revenue by country and region for US-listed firms, fiscal 2011-2025, rebuilt from the SEC Financial Statement and
  Notes data sets. 23,072 annual reports from 3,404 firms. Agrees with Compustat first-reported geographic segments
  in 90.9% of held-out firm-years.
